  "onboarding.done.announce.label": "Free shout-out: {product} may post once on its own {account} account about what we do, written in our name.",
  "onboarding.announce.later": "{product} can announce your company on X once it knows the website is yours. Sign in with an address at it, or prove the website later in the company settings under {page}.",
  "onboarding.announce.whenLive": "Posted a day after your website made with {product} goes live.",
