  "workflows.webhooks.signing": "Send a POST request whose body is a JSON object. Sign it in the {signatureHeader} header: t= and the time in Unix seconds, a comma, then v1= and the HMAC-SHA256 of that time, a full stop and the raw body, in hex, keyed with the secret. This is the scheme Stripe uses. A request signed more than five minutes from now is refused. To make a retry count once, send the same id each time in the {deliveryHeader} header.",
